# ethren (M3.1): Table 1-3, the 0-level occupations (docs/rules/funnel.md), for the funnel's rolling screen
# (GUIScripts/ethren/FunnelRoll.py). Rows by the occupation id, the row's lowest d100 number (the OCCU
# record's id, M2.9); LOW-HIGH the d100 range. RACE is race.ids (1 human, 2 elf, 4 dwarf, 5 halfling). WEAPON
# and GOOD are rows of dccoccit.2da (the item, its name, ammunition, money). SUB is the row's sub-roll: FARMER
# the farmer's crop (1d8) and a duplicate's animal, ANIMAL a duplicate's animal (1d6), CART the pushcart's
# contents (1d6). SKILLS are the skill tags (funnel.md, "Suggested tags per occupation"), | between them.
# NAME uses _ for spaces.
